      <title>博主通过焊点图反推苹果A20 Pro为7核GPU</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260902/%E5%8D%9A%E4%B8%BB%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E7%84%8A%E7%82%B9%E5%9B%BE%E5%8F%8D%E6%8E%A8%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9CA20-Pro%E4%B8%BA7%E6%A0%B8GPU/</link>
